perience, skills, services, work) lives as typed files in `src/data/` with no translatable strings.\n\n1. CMS overhead is not justified for a solo, developer-edited portfolio.\n2. If editing friction appears, Keystatic is the upgrade path (research ticket 02).\n3. Not applicable: with no CMS, the i18n file decision (ticket 06) is unconstrained.\n\nSee `docs/adr/005-cms-strategy.md`.\n''')\n\nm='.scratch/brzezina-dev-portfolio/map.md'\nsub(m,'**Stack decisions still open as of 2026-08-19:** deployment mode (ticket 10), CMS (ticket 07), mailer (ticket 08). i18n library resolved: next-intl confirmed (ticket 06). Radix Primitives confirmed (ticket 05).',\n '**Stack decisions:** all resolved as of 2026-10-26. Deployment mode (ticket 10, Vercel-native), CMS (ticket 07, none), mailer (ticket 08, Resend), i18n (ticket 06, next-intl) and Radix Primitives (ticket 05).')\nsub(m,'- **Styling**: Radix UI (Primitives or Themes — open) + Emotion/styled-components + CSS custom properties. CSS Modules, Tailwind, shadcn, MUI all rejected.',\n '- **Styling**: Radix UI Primitives + Emotion + CSS custom properties. Radix Themes, CSS Modules, Tailwind, shadcn, MUI all rejected.')\nsub(m,'- **Deployment mode**: `output: \\'export\\'` (static) vs Vercel-native SSG — open question, see ticket 10','- **Deployment mode**: Vercel-native (resolved, ticket 10)')\nsub(m,'- **Contact form**: approach depends on ticket 10 — Vercel route handler (Resend) if Vercel-native; external service if static export','- **Contact form**: Vercel route handler sending through Resend (resolved, tickets 08 and 10)')\nsub(m,'MUI rejected; Radix UI + CSS custom properties + CSS Modules confirmed','MUI rejected; Radix UI Primitives + Emotion + CSS custom properties confirmed (CSS Modules were dropped later, see case-study log)')\nsub(m,'- Styling library — ','- [CMS strategy](issues/07-cms-strategy.md) — No CMS: copy in `messages/*.json`, structured data as typed files in `src/data/`; Keystatic stays the upgrade path